微微回头，用眼角扫她。涟漪顿时浑身僵硬，这男人真的是大虎？为什么他的眼满是杀气？这种杀气并非是现在想杀她，而是那种与生俱来的杀气，仿佛是在千百条人命中磨砺出的嗜血杀气。不动声色的向后退了半步，心中警惕起来，秀眉忍不住皱紧。马大叔说，这男人是苏峰从山上捡来的，一方面为了家里多添个劳动力，另一方面怕自己又懒又胖的女儿嫁不出去，便硬让本尊嫁给他。也就是说，这人的身份成谜！两人就这么互相对视，空气仿佛凝固一般。苏涟漪虽是现代人，也有一些身手，但刚刚的较量便能看出，两人的实力相差太多。转念一想，这人和本尊生活那么长时间都没动什么杀机，说明“苏涟漪”没什么危险。无论他身份如何，只要他没发现苏涟漪换了人，应该便能维持这种相安无事。想到这，涟漪便确定了和大虎相处的方针——井水不犯河水。“大虎你刚下田定然是累了，先打水梳洗一下，我去做饭。”说完，便一溜烟的跑了，逃跑一般。做饭？男人的眉皱得更深，这饭，向来是他做，平日里这胖女人在家什么都不做，每日肖想李家二公子，天天做梦嫁入李府当少奶奶，今日怎么突然变了？今日的胖女人确实不一样，平日的她，双眼空洞轻浮，要么是目中无人，要么便是幻想着李家二公子犯花痴，但今日的苏涟漪，容貌虽还是平日里的不堪，但双眼却异常清澈。那种清澈，如同月下泉水一般，让人看了便心情舒畅。男人不懂为何苏涟漪会有这种变化，也懒得去多想，他不信一个人能突然变化，随便捡起了件衣服便换了上。厨房里，苏涟漪略略想了一下，很快便有了主意——做面疙瘩汤。家里没米，只有些许面，若是现在和面蒸馒头，等吃上，估计都要天亮了。面粉、蔬菜，最好的方法就是面疙瘩汤。涟漪的手艺不好，因为是医生，平日里时间紧得很，问题她还有些许洁癖，面对食品卫生丝毫得不到保障的天朝，她不得不学了一系列速食食谱，这疙瘩汤就是其中一个。拿手术刀时，是一副巧手，做疙瘩汤时，也是一副巧手。没多长时间，随着一股清香，疙瘩汤出锅了。男人换了衣服，刚刚跨入房门，便不由自主的闻到了这股从未闻过的香味。这个时空是没有疙瘩汤的，面就是面，汤就是汤，很少这么搀和着吃。当男人看见擦得干净如初的桌子上摆放着两碗如同猪食一般的饭食时，眼中的不屑越来越多。他刚刚还在纳闷这胖子怎么变了，原来还是烂泥扶不起墙。涟漪从厨房又端来了菜，麻汁青菜。从今天开始，她要减肥，所以拒绝吃油腻的肉，可怜的大虎也只能陪着她减肥了。当男人看到这青菜上乱七八糟淋上的麻汁时，眉头皱得更紧，转身便准备去厨房为自己做吃的，毕竟干了一天农活，现在肚子饿得紧。“喂，大虎，你要去哪？”涟漪忙问。男人楞了一下，即便是再沉默寡言，如今都忍不住低吼出声，“做饭。”“我已经做完了啊，这些够两人吃的，而且家里没面也没菜了，你怎么做饭？”涟漪说着，回头看了看桌上的饭菜。疙瘩汤很正常，面疙瘩很均匀，菜叶和米白色的汤汁糅杂，让人大开胃口，其上还淋了一些香油，整个房间内都是淡淡的香气。麻汁菜叶也没有问题，麻汁是用水调匀，里面放了蒜末和盐，吃起来非但没有青菜的生涩，还很香甜，即能开胃，又是减肥的第一菜肴。若是平日，男人宁可饿着也不吃这“猪食”，但今天，真是饿得紧了。平时申时他就能回来，但今天有些意外情况，一直快到亥时才归。涟漪无奈，不知他饿没饿，反正她是饿了。不管他，自己先坐下吃了起来。先喝一口香香的汤汁，温热的汤汁从口顺着食道入胃，顿时犹如沙漠变成绿洲一般，重新有了活力。咬了几口面疙瘩，而后夹了一些沾着麻汁的菜叶，嘎吱嘎吱吃得欢快。不知是心里作用还是什么，涟漪觉得这里的菜更好吃，也许没有农药化肥催熟剂，吃得更为放心。“咕噜——”男人的肚子尴尬的响了。看着那土绿色圆滚滚的身子吃“猪食”，他越来越鄙夷，但这香味却勾得他越来越饿。想到厨房里已没了菜和面，他终于一咬牙，几步走到了桌前，坐在涟漪对面，犹豫再三，最终小心翼翼的尝试着喝了一口。带着菜香和面香的汤汁刚刚入口，他大为惊讶，这看起来好像随手乱炖的东西，竟然如此美味？男人进食的姿势很优雅，即便是十分饥饿，却丝毫不狼狈。但在优雅的姿势下，其饭量却是大得惊人，没几口，一大碗疙瘩汤便悉数入腹。男人尴尬了一下，这一碗勾起了他的食欲。他不擅长做饭，平日里也是弄熟了勉强吃，已经有多久没吃过这样的饭食了？还没吃饱……怎么办？涟漪用余光便明白了他想什么，扑哧一笑，“厨房里还有很多，我帮你盛吧。”说着，便站了起来。一抬头，看见男人的脸，涟漪吓了一跳！这男人的脸，怎么……当男人看见涟漪眼中震惊的异色时，赶忙偏过头去，表情微变，眼光更是冰冷，在冰冷的眸子深处，是让人不易察觉的伤痛。他的脸就是这么可怕，人不人、鬼不鬼，本以为从小到大被鄙夷多了便习惯了，没想到，看见人嫌恶的目光还是会疼。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/mingyiguinu/5.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "When he first arrived in the different world 005, the handsome man seemed to be looking for something. He looked left and right. When he found that he couldn't find it, he turned around and left the room. From beginning to end, he didn't even look at Su Lianyi. It seems that this man should be the legendary Big Tiger. Ripple dropped the half-broken wooden stick, feeling very ashamed and guilty. \"Dahu, I'm sorry, it was too dark just now and I didn't see you clearly. Did it hurt you?\" He followed the tall figure and chased after him. A tall man named Dahu found what he was looking for in the middle of the yard - a change of clothes. Beneath the mud, two sharp eyebrows frowned, wondering why this lazy and greedy fat woman threw all her clothes into the courtyard. Did she want to throw away these clothes? \"Dahu, those clothes are too dirty. Don't wear them yet. I'll wash them later and dry them early tomorrow morning.\" Because she just hit someone indiscriminately, Lianyi felt very ashamed of Dahu. The man's body stiffened again, as calm as he was, but today he looked back as if he had seen a ghost. He turned his head slightly and glanced at her with the corners of his eyes. Lianyi suddenly became stiff. Is this man really a big tiger? Why are his eyes filled with murderous intent? This kind of murderous intent is not that he wants to kill her now, but the kind of murderous intent that is innate, as if it is the bloodthirsty and murderous intent that has been honed by thousands of lives. He calmly took half a step back, his heart became wary, and his beautiful eyebrows couldn't help but frown. Uncle Ma said that this man was picked up by Su Feng from the mountains. On the one hand, he wanted to add more labor to the family, and on the other hand, he was afraid that his lazy and fat daughter would not be able to marry, so he forced me to marry him. In other words, this person’s identity is a mystery! The two just looked at each other, and the air seemed to freeze. Although Su Lianyi is a modern person and has some skills, it can be seen from the previous contest that there is a huge difference in strength between the two. After thinking about it, this person has lived with me for such a long time without any murderous intentions, which means that \"Su Lianyi\" is not in any danger. No matter what his identity is, as long as he doesn't find out that Su Lianyi has changed people, he should be able to maintain this peaceful relationship. Thinking of this, Lianyi decided on the policy of getting along with Dahu - to keep the water in the well without violating the river. \"Dahu, you must be tired just after you went to the fields. First, fetch water and freshen up. I'll go cook.\" After saying that, he ran away quickly, as if running away. Cook? The man's frown deepened. He had always cooked this meal. On weekdays, this fat woman did nothing at home. She thought about the second son of the Li family every day and dreamed of marrying into the Li family as a young mistress. Why did it suddenly change today? Today's fat woman is indeed different. She usually has hollow and frivolous eyes, either arrogant or fantasizing about the second son of the Li family being a nymphomaniac. But today's Su Lianyi, although her appearance is still ugly as usual, her eyes are extremely clear. It's as clear as spring water under the moon, making people feel comfortable just looking at it. The man didn't understand why Su Lianyi had such a change, and he didn't bother to think about it. He didn't believe that a person could change suddenly, so he picked up some clothes and changed them. In the kitchen, Su Lianyi thought about it for a moment, and soon came up with an idea - to make noodle soup. There is no rice at home, only some noodles. If I make steamed buns now and eat them, it will probably be dawn. Flour, vegetables, and the best way to make it is gnocchi soup. Lianyi's craftsmanship is not good, because she is a doctor, and her time is very tight on weekdays. The problem is that she is also a little bit hysterical. Facing a country where food hygiene is not guaranteed at all, she had to learn a series of quick recipes, and this pimple soup is one of them. He has a skillful hand when holding a scalpel, and he also has a skillful hand when making pimple soup. Not long after, with a fragrance, the pimple soup came out of the pot. The man changed his clothes and as soon as he stepped through the door, he couldn't help but smell this fragrance that he had never smelled before. There is no lump soup in this time and space. Noodles are noodles and soup is soup. They are rarely eaten together like this. When the man saw two bowls of food that looked like pig food placed on the clean table, the disdain in his eyes grew. Just now he was wondering why the fat man had changed, but it turned out that mud still couldn't hold up the wall. Ripple brought another dish from the kitchen, green vegetables with sesame sauce. Starting from today, she wants to lose weight, so she refuses to eat greasy meat. Poor Dahu can only accompany her to lose weight. When the man saw the messy sesame juice drizzled on the green vegetables, he frowned even more. He turned around and prepared to go to the kitchen to make food for himself. After all, he was hungry after a day of farm work. \"Hey, Dahu, where are you going?\" Ripple asked hurriedly. The man was stunned for a moment. Even though he was taciturn, he couldn't help but growl, \"Cooking.\" \"I've already finished cooking. This is enough for two people, and there is no food or vegetables at home. How can you cook?\" Ripple said, looking back at the food on the table. The gnocchi soup is very normal, the gnocchi are very uniform, the vegetable leaves and the off-white soup are mixed together, which is very appetizing. Some sesame oil is also poured on it, and the whole room is filled with a light aroma. There is no problem with t